## Task lines that are text

The next line starts like a task, but it is indented four columns after a paragraph, so it continues the paragraph:
    - [ ] continues the paragraph above

An ordered item other than 1 can't interrupt a paragraph either:
2. [ ] continues this paragraph too

- An item whose text runs on
      - [ ] past its content column, so it is text

A task-shaped line in code is code:

```text
- [ ] in a fence
```

    - [ ] in an indented code block

## After the text

- [ ] Still a task after them
